WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.467 --> 00:00:09.031
There are many different balls.

2
00:00:09.032 --> 00:00:14.387
Balls come in many sizes and shapes.

3
00:00:14.388 --> 00:00:17.753
I am black, white, and round.

4
00:00:17.754 --> 00:00:20.878
What am I?

5
00:00:20.879 --> 00:00:24.180
I am a soccer ball.

6
00:00:24.181 --> 00:00:27.820
How can you play with me?

7
00:00:27.821 --> 00:00:32.848
You can kick me!

8
00:00:32.849 --> 00:00:37.507
I am orange and round with thin black stripes.

9
00:00:37.508 --> 00:00:39.248
What am I?

10
00:00:39.249 --> 00:00:42.919
I am a basketball.

11
00:00:42.920 --> 00:00:46.509
How can you play with me?

12
00:00:46.510 --> 00:00:52.322
You can shoot me into a hoop!

13
00:00:52.323 --> 00:00:56.451
I am brown and I am shaped like an oval.

14
00:00:56.452 --> 00:00:59.269
What am I?

15
00:00:59.270 --> 00:01:02.589
I am a football.

16
00:01:02.590 --> 00:01:06.040
How can you play with me?

17
00:01:06.041 --> 00:01:11.959
You can throw me and kick me!

18
00:01:11.960 --> 00:01:17.170
I am small, round, white, and hard.

19
00:01:17.171 --> 00:01:20.020
What am I?

20
00:01:20.021 --> 00:01:22.776
I am a baseball.

21
00:01:22.777 --> 00:01:25.964
How can you play with me?

22
00:01:25.965 --> 00:01:31.383
You can hit me with a bat!

23
00:01:31.384 --> 00:01:37.854
I am round, small, fuzzy, bouncy, and bright yellow.

24
00:01:37.855 --> 00:01:40.683
What am I?

25
00:01:40.684 --> 00:01:43.838
I am a tennis ball.

26
00:01:43.839 --> 00:01:47.215
How can you play with me?

27
00:01:47.216 --> 00:01:53.179
You can hit me with a racket!

28
00:01:53.180 --> 00:01:56.938
I am tiny, white, and bumpy.

29
00:01:56.939 --> 00:02:00.172
What am I?

30
00:02:00.173 --> 00:02:03.587
I am a golf ball.

31
00:02:03.588 --> 00:02:06.912
How can you play with me?

32
00:02:06.913 --> 00:02:12.440
You can swing a club and hit me!

33
00:02:12.441 --> 00:02:15.317
What's your favorite ball?

34
00:02:15.318 --> 00:02:19.639
"Pick me! Pick me!"
